NDIP-3 A2 mutation-plan record envelope
Date: 2026-10-04
Base commit: 0e37d38317ba131d6ace7a4b7f70ff7ea8440f63

Source-derived bound:
  readyProjections considers the union of the prior Message Lane, replacement
  Message Lane, and reservation Lane (at most 3). Each projected Lane reads
  its Lane value twice. Each of DUE, ORDERED, and NATIVE can visit at most one
  excluded old head and one retained successor, and validates at most one
  candidate by point-reading its Message. The shared head plan therefore reads
  at most 3 * (2 + 3 * (2 + 1)) = 33 Store records.

Change:
  Authoritative Owner activation rejects a finite head-read policy whose
  maxRecords is below 33. This closes only the records dimension; it does not
  certify a byte/allocation envelope or production policy assembly.

